// The feature registry -- the ONLY place a gate is declared.
//
//   CRPT_FEATURE(name, default)
//
// To add a gate: one line here, then `if (ctx.on(Feat::name))` where it
// applies. Nothing else changes: not DecodeHints, not the vendored copy of
// it, not any signature, not the calculators. A gate is switched from the
// ladder string ("+name" / "-name"); an unknown name there is a hard error.
//
// The two below are the DMGridRefineOptions flags. Their defaults are what
// DecodeHints::dmGridRefine() carries, so the registry default is what
// applies when the caller set nothing; the setter still works and wins.
CRPT_FEATURE(regionGrowing, false)
CRPT_FEATURE(rsFeedback,    false)
